      "caption": null,
      "body": "ক) যদি সকল $x$ এর জন্য $ax + b = px + q$ হয়, তবে $x = 0$ ও $x = 1$ বসিয়ে পাই, $b = q$ এবং $a + b = p + q$ যা থেকে দেখা যায় যে, $a = p, b = q$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x",
        "ax + b = px + q",
        "x = 0",
        "x = 1",
        "b = q",
        "a + b = p + q",
        "a = p, b = q"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 47,
