    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.6-p002",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "খ) যদি সকল $x$ এর জন্য $ax^2 + bx + c = px^2 + qx + r$ হয়, তবে $x = 0, x = 1$ ও $x = -1$ বসিয়ে পাই, $c = r, a + b + c = p + q + r$ এবং $a - b + c = p - q + r$ যা থেকে দেখা যায় যে, $a = p, b = q, c = r$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x",
        "ax^2 + bx + c = px^2 + qx + r",
        "x = 0, x = 1",
        "x = -1",
        "c = r, a + b + c = p + q + r",
        "a - b + c = p - q + r",
        "a = p, b = q, c = r"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 47,
      "pdfPageEnd": 47,
      "printedPageStart": 42,
      "printedPageEnd": 42,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c02-t2.6-p003",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "গ) সাধারণভাবে দেখা যায় যে, যদি সকল $x$ এর জন্য $a_0x^n + a_1x^{n-1} + a_2x^{n-2} + \\dots + a_{n-1}x + a_n = p_0x^n + p_1x^{n-1} + p_2x^{n-2} + \\dots + p_{n-1}x + p_n$ হয়, তবে, $a_0 = p_0, a_1 = p_1, \\dots, a_{n-1} = p_{n-1}, a_n = p_n$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "x",
        "a_0x^n + a_1x^{n-1} + a_2x^{n-2} + \\dots + a_{n-1}x + a_n = p_0x^n + p_1x^{n-1} + p_2x^{n-2} + \\dots + p_{n-1}x + p_n",
        "a_0 = p_0, a_1 = p_1, \\dots, a_{n-1} = p_{n-1}, a_n = p_n"
      ],
